TEXT -224 -288 Left 3 ;PT1000 temperature sensing - UHF module - single channel
TEXT -224 -240 Left 2 ;Range -40 / +125 degC  ->  Vout 0.10 V / 2.97 V  (~17.4 mV/degC)  |  3V3 single supply, ratiometric
